id: CTB-SRC0033-r2
source: SRC-0033
section: §3.2
kind: requirement
scope: ARC
title: Rule R2: one source of truth, transitional structures only if declared
applied-in: STG-00.A-1
distinct-from: LXM-REQ-000144, LXM-REQ-000221
text: Rule R2, one source of truth: there is no parallel source of truth. A transitional structure is allowed only if it is declared with an owner, a reason, an exit condition and a date, is never authoritative, and is removed by its exit condition; a transitional register fails CI and readiness on an undeclared or expired entry.
